  "notes": [
    "The SVG is an original text-free tabletop layout; JSON labels carry zone meanings. No commercial character illustration is copied.",
    "Player areas repeat for 2–6 active seats and hide unused seats. The hand container allows up to three cards for the Chancellor resolution; ordinary play keeps one.",
    "The shared center distinguishes the draw pile, one hidden set-aside card, the two-player three-card face-up reserve, and remaining favor-token supply.",
    "All used/discarded cards are public and remain in the owner’s row for the round; eliminated players reveal their hand and reference card state changes to broken-seal.",
    "Current 21-card edition is default. Classic 16-card option is separately declared and restricted to 2–4 players.",
    "This asset package does not claim app integration, automatic card-effect resolution, or an initialized game state."
  ],
